<Base title="Privacy · AutoDeck" description="What AutoDeck collects, why, and who sees it." page="privacy">
  <section class="phero"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="lede">Last updated 18 October 2026. This explains what the AutoDeck website and app collect and how we use it.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="s" style="padding-top:40px"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px;display:grid;gap:22px">
    <div><h3>Who we are</h3><p>AutoDeck, a sole proprietorship of Shalin Sheth, Sunbeam Complex, Old Sharda Mandir Rd, Ellisbridge, Ahmedabad, Gujarat 380006. Phone and WhatsApp: <a class="link" href="tel:+919898679711">+91 98986 79711</a>. Email: <a class="link" href="mailto:autodeckstudio@gmail.com">autodeckstudio@gmail.com</a>.</p></div>
    <div><h3>What we collect</h3><ul style="margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:20px;color:#b8babb;font-size:14px;display:grid;gap:6px"><li>Your Google account name and email, used to sign you in.</li><li>Your phone number, if you give it, so the studio can reach you about a booking.</li><li>Your cars: make, model, year, colour, plate number, kilometres, photos you add, and a photo of the registration certificate (RC) if you upload one.</li><li>Your bookings, job progress, photos taken of your car during service, messages about a job, invoices, warranty records and Club plan use.</li><li>If you list a car for sale: the listing details, photos, and your name and phone, which only the studio sees.</li><li>Notification settings, and a device token if you allow notifications.</li><li>Payment status for your bookings and plans. Card and UPI details are handled by Razorpay. We do not store them.</li></ul></div>
    <div><h3>Why we use it</h3><p>To sign you in, take and run your bookings, keep you updated, issue invoices and warranties, take payments, review cars for sale, and answer your questions.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Who sees it</h3><p>Our studio team. Razorpay, for payments. Google, for sign-in. Our hosting and messaging providers, only to run the service. We do not sell your data. We may share it if the law requires.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Keeping it</h3><p>We keep your records while your account is active and as needed for invoices, warranties, tax and legal duties.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Your choices</h3><p>You can turn notifications off in your phone settings. To see, correct or delete your data, call or WhatsApp us at the number above. We delete what we are not required to keep.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Children</h3><p>The app is for adults who own or look after a car.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Changes</h3><p>If this policy changes, we will update this page.</p></div>
    </div></section>
</Base>
